#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/VPNDropProtectionCheckbox.java:97
msgid "-Drop protection"
msgstr "-protection anti-coupure"

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/VPNDropProtectionCheckbox.java:101
msgid ""
"When enabled, BitTorrent transfers will pause if your VPN is disconnected"
msgstr ""
"Si activé, les transferts BitTorrent seront mis en pause si votre VPN est "
"déconnecté"

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/VPNStatusButton.java:80
msgid ""
"Due to current settings without VPN connection BitTorrent will not start. "
"Click to see the settings screen"
msgstr ""
"En raison des paramètres actuels sans connexion VPN BitTorrent ne démarre "
"pas. Cliquez pour voir l'écran des paramètres"

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/VPNStatusButton.java:84
msgid "VPN Off: BitTorrent disabled"
msgstr "VPN Off: BitTorrent désactivé"

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/VPNStatusButton.java:120
msgid ""
"FrostWire has detected a VPN connection, your privacy is safe from prying "
"eyes."
msgstr ""
"FrostWire a détecté une connexion VPN, votre vie privée est l’abri des "
"regards indiscrets."

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/VPNStatusButton.java:124
msgid ""
"FrostWire can't detect an encrypted VPN connection, your privacy is at risk. "
"Click icon to set up an encrypted VPN connection."
msgstr ""
"FrostWire ne peut pas détecter une connexion VPN cryptée, votre vie privée "
"est en péril. Cliquez sur l’icône pour configurer une connexion VPN cryptée."

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/actions/FileMenuActions.java:88
msgid "O&pen .Torrent, Magnet or Video URL"
msgstr "O&uvrir .Torrent, Magnet ou URL vidéo"

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/actions/FileMenuActions.java:90
msgid "Opens a magnet link or torrent file"
msgstr "Ouvre un lien “Aimant:” ou un fichier “.torrent”."

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/actions/FileMenuActions.java:105
msgid "Download .Torrent or Magnet link"
msgstr "Télécharger le lien .Torrent ou Magnet"

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/actions/FileMenuActions.java:133
msgid ""
"Type a magnet link, the file path or web address of a torrent file and "
"FrostWire will start downloading it for you."
msgstr ""
"Entrez un lien Aimant, ou le chemin ou l’adresse Web d’un fichier torrent et "
"FrostWire le téléchargera pour vous."

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/actions/FileMenuActions.java:138
msgid "Open:"
msgstr "Ouvrir:"

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/actions/FileMenuActions.java:227
msgid ""
"FrostWire cannot download this address. Make sure you typed it correctly, "
"and then try again."
msgstr ""
"FrostWire ne peut rien charger à cette adresse. Vérifiez que vous l'avez "
"correctement tapée, puis réessayez."

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/actions/FileMenuActions.java:248
msgid "&Close"
msgstr "&Fermer"

#: /Users/gubatron/workspace/frostwire/desktop/src/main/java/com/limegroup/gnutella/gui/actions/FileMenuActions.java:249
